  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through GENDER EQUALITY in Palestine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through GENDER EQUALITY young Palestinian women (age 13-35) will be empowered to stand up for their rights and take part in decision making at a local, national and international level. Through awareness and advocacy campaigns young women will attain tools to challenge the Palestinian patriarchal society and fight Sexual Gender Based Violence. Safe spaces will be used to give young women a place to meet and share their own experiences in a supportive environment.</narrative>
  </description>
